flowchart TB
    classDef client fill:#0f172a,stroke:#38bdf8,color:#f8fafc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef control fill:#0b3b52,stroke:#22d3ee,color:#f8fafc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef safety fill:#164e63,stroke:#5eead4,color:#f8fafc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef state fill:#1e293b,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#f8fafc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evidence fill:#14532d,stroke:#86efac,color:#f8fafc,stroke-width:2px

    Client[Authorized operator<br/>or MCP client]:::client --> API[REST API / MCP bridge]:::control
    API --> Auth[Token authentication<br/>and caller context]:::safety
    Auth --> Policy[Campaign policy engine<br/>scope • capability • window]:::safety
    Policy --> Store[(Durable job store<br/>audit • lease • idempotency)]:::state
    Store --> Worker[Lease-aware worker]:::control
    Worker --> Runner[Fail-closed sandbox runner<br/>immutable image • least privilege]:::safety
    Runner --> Evidence[Evidence references<br/>logs • result metadata]:::evidence

    Planner[AURA planner]:::client --> Review[Policy reviewer]:::safety
    Review --> Executor[Bounded executor]:::control
    Executor --> API
    Evidence --> EvidenceReview[Evidence reviewer]:::evidence

    linkStyle default stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:2px
